-- the two are different maps, proved: so a reaction record that stores one atom map is storing a
-- choice, and the degeneracy that enters a rate constant is the size of the orbit it chose from.
-- Here the orbit has two elements and the record has room for one.
at-maps-differ : (at-map-id ≡ at-map-swap) → Empty
at-maps-differ p = at-h1-not-h2 (λ i → am-fun at-mol at-mol (p i) at-h1)
